#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:10002
msgid "MulAndDiv"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:10004
msgid "参考：`tvm/src/relay/quantize/realize.cc`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:30002
msgid "这段代码定义了一个名为`MulAndDiv`的内联函数，用于计算 `data * s1 / s2`。如果可能的话，它会使用位移运算来优化计算过程。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:30004
msgid "函数接收5个参数："
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:30005
msgid "`data`：需要进行计算的数据；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:30006
msgid "`s1` 和 `s2`：两个浮点数，用于计算 `data * s1 / s2`；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:30007
msgid "`dtype`：数据类型；"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:30008
msgid "`data_shape`：数据的形状。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:30010
msgid ""
"函数首先获取当前的量化配置（`QConfig::Current()`），然后判断 `s1` 和 `s2` 是否相等，如果相等则直接返回 "
"`data`。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../doc/old/old/relay-quant/realize/MulAndDiv.ipynb:30012
msgid ""
"接下来，计算 `factor = s1 / s2`，并计算 `shift_factor = std::log2(factor)`。如果 "
"`shift_factor` 大于 0 且为整数，则对 `data` 进行左移运算。如果 `factor` 为整数，则对 `data` "
"进行乘法运算。否则，根据量化配置中的舍入方式（`cfg->rounding`）进行定点乘法运算，并将结果转换为指定的数据类型。"
msgstr ""

